extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PY3pmeMPzVUQ7kNvwHQuTjC&_nc_oc=Adpk_scb4X6LQ_JMYcnZgLTdKw1hlDZqiNRE5npmFkj_XxQyHWI5TALYMxbRYbKd3V0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMUzPL_-eX0WeyxoBQREkborZCWhSKwoEeRinmYp7zxZw&oe=6ACE4C56"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z76NgsQicbQQ7kNvwFkuN-M&_nc_oc=AdozcHcSVqCNpeHFPT_WlV7pg1Rbv4wPYlm7eoJKYi4v-vWosK67GNZPI2LSMIkG_7Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNFztgu08Nj0N5dqU6zJCVUCkVcOcwtzOB77NcR0IpOsA&oe=6ACE53A2"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eoB9n0lG6D4Q7kNvwH6QfRr&_nc_oc=AdrMpwsTn7cAxXZGU-QxX8aNUiq5fFizz3vnx7FVmuGxV2XbMtqK7wLXI0Ds_d6Y_YU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOmhCAgzm1JSfstc60UOcWMgAyFLXa2lY1HoS7jGCxJcw&oe=6ACE5B99"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":